            "review_text": "Maubruyere\nParis, France22 contributions\n0\nExcellent meals and friendly staff\nMay 2018 • Family\nWent to this restaurant for dinner and lunch. Tried and loved the banh cuon, pho, bun cha, nem nuong (spelling approximate). All delicious, and I know my Vietnamese food. A nice mix of locals and tourists (more tourists at night). The staff are extremely friendly and will kindly provide guidance on how to eat certain dishes. A great place to recommend.\nWritten May 5, 2018",
