            "review_title": "Review at Rainbow Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Peter C\nOnchan, Isle of Man45 contributions\n0\nReally poor service. ok ish food\nApr 2018 • Couples\nSo we went here last night as it was close to the hotel and had people in which is normally a good sign.\nJust after we ordered the guy at the table behind us asked to pay. The waitress then turned up at his table with more food - to which he said that explains why I'm still hungry so she offered to put it in a takeaway tub !!!!!\nMy food came out and I'd finished it before we managed to find a waiter and ask where my girlfriend meal was..... they had forgotten it and went off to cook it.\nTables either side of us had both been given wrong meals and had to send them back for the right ones. \nAt 145k dong each main I'd say it was expensive for what you got even though it was quite tasty. But wouldn't go back for the service. They never came round to see you after taking the order so no chance to get more drinks etc\nRead more\nWritten April 21, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
